  "limitations": [
    "Only standard range controls in one pinned ARM64 binary at 100% scale; not Chrome, Vivaldi, Firefox or their derivatives.",
    "Browser chrome, menus, text editing, other widget types, touch, accessibility, IME, HiDPI and performance remain incomplete or unqualified.",
    "Constant-value ranges excluded: installed native slider knob geometry divides by range width; correct in underlying UI library, not by copying geometry into adapter.",
    "Small discrete domains use native ticks; dense domains use native continuous input and engine data validation. Arbitrary step bases and dense rounding need broader qualification.",
    "Automatic metrics/layout and dynamic style/model combinations remain unqualified.",
    "Earlier progress/scrollbar initial-frame fallback observations remain unresolved.",
    "Internal offsets and layouts require a fresh audit for every supported binary; no universal browser plugin ABI."
  ],
